<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Order Successful | VelvetAura</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#f6f6f8;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
height:100vh;
}

.card{

width:90%;
max-width:650px;
background:#fff;
padding:45px;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
text-align:center;

}

.success{

width:110px;
height:110px;
background:#e8fff0;
border-radius:50%;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
font-size:55px;
margin:auto;
color:#28a745;
margin-bottom:25px;

}

h1{

color:#222;
margin-bottom:10px;

}

p{

color:#666;
margin-bottom:15px;

}

.order-box{

background:#fafafa;
padding:20px;
border-radius:12px;
margin:25px 0;
text-align:left;

}

.order-box p{

margin:10px 0;
font-size:15px;

}

.btn{

display:inline-block;
padding:14px 28px;
margin:10px;
text-decoration:none;
border-radius:8px;
font-weight:600;
transition:.3s;

}

.shop{

background:#e91e63;
color:#fff;

}

.orders{

background:#333;
color:#fff;

}

.btn:hover{

transform:translateY(-2px);

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

<div class="success">
✔
</div>

<h1>Order Placed Successfully!</h1>

<p>
Thank you for shopping with
<b>VelvetAura</b>.
</p>

<div class="order-box">

<p><b>Order ID:</b> <%= order._id %></p>

<p><b>Payment:</b> <%= order.paymentMethod %></p>

<p><b>Status:</b> <%= order.orderStatus %></p>

<p><b>Estimated Delivery:</b> 3-5 Business Days</p>

</div>

<a href="/" class="btn shop">
Continue Shopping
</a>

<a href="/my-orders" class="btn orders">
My Orders
</a>

</div>

</body>
</html>